#. English: Choose your hero and flashcard deck. Heroes have special abilities that can change drastically how the game plays and the deck is the flashcard deck that will be used throughout the entire run.
msgid "tutorial.loadout"
msgstr ""

#. English: Path choice
msgid "tutorial.path_choice_intro.title"
msgstr ""

#. English: Choose your next encounter! Every encounter counts as one day and enemies get stronger each day. Make it count!
msgid "tutorial.path_choice_1"
msgstr ""

#. English: Gacha Collection
msgid "tutorial.gacha_inspect_run.title"
msgstr ""

#. English: This is your current collection. Hover over or press and hold a GachaBall to inspect it (a quick click selects). You can merge some GachaBalls of the same tier if you've already unlocked the resulting GachaBall in this playthrough or level them up by merging two of the same level units, just click or drag one onto another. You unlock GachaBall recipes by getting them during the game.
msgid "tutorial.gacha_inspect_run.mouse"
msgstr ""

#. English: This is your current collection. Press and hold a GachaBall to inspect it (a quick tap selects). You can merge some GachaBalls of the same tier if you've already unlocked the resulting GachaBall in this playthrough or level them up by merging two of the same level units, just tap or drag one onto another. You unlock GachaBall recipes by getting them during the game.
msgid "tutorial.gacha_inspect_run.touch"
msgstr ""

#. English: Merging or destroying gachaballs in battle only affects the current encounter. Your permanent collection remains unchanged. Each battle resets your gachaballs to their base state.
msgid "tutorial.gacha_inspect_battle"
msgstr ""

#. English: Spend Gold to expand your collection. Reroll the stock if you're looking for something specific, but be warned: the price rises with every roll!
msgid "tutorial.shop"
msgstr ""

#. English: A moment of respite. Master the flashcard minigame to earn tokens, then spend them on these machines for permanent Hero upgrades.
msgid "tutorial.rest_site"
msgstr ""

#. English: New Card and Review time!
msgid "tutorial.new_card_intro.title"
msgstr ""

#. English: This is when new flashcards are added to your Mastery Deck.\n\nA new one will be added every mini game session.\n\nYou start with 6 flashcards already unlocked, so try to remember at least a few before starting the mini-game.\n\nYour battle resources depend on it!
msgid "tutorial.new_card_intro"
msgstr ""

#. English: Tokens and Gacha Machines
msgid "tutorial.battle_management_intro.title"
msgstr ""

#. English: Use your tokens to pull Units and Items from the Gacha Machines below!\n\nEach machine has a different cost. Spend your tokens wisely!
msgid "tutorial.battle_management"
msgstr ""

#. English: Building your team
msgid "tutorial.first_draw.title"
msgstr ""

#. English: New capsules are sent to your Bench.\n\nFrom there, you can deploy units to your Battle Lineup, or equip and use items on your units.\n\nIf your Bench is full, any new capsules you pull will be sent directly to the Discard Pile.
msgid "tutorial.first_draw_1"
msgstr ""

#. English: How Battle Works
msgid "tutorial.first_draw_combat.title"
msgstr ""

#. English: Your team goes first, starting from the frontmost unit to the back. Then the enemy team will go in the same order.\n\nDefeat all enemy units to win. If your hero dies, you lose.\n\nIf neither side is defeated, a new turn begins.\n\nPress "Battle!" when you're happy with your team.
msgid "tutorial.first_draw_2"
msgstr ""

#. English: Choose your equipment wisely. Units have limited slots, and once an item is equipped, it cannot be removed. Every choice counts!
msgid "tutorial.equip"
msgstr ""

#. English: Choose Merge to combine two into a single, more powerful entity, or Swap to reorganize your ranks? The choice is yours.
msgid "tutorial.merge_choice"
msgstr ""

#. English: Battle Capsules
msgid "tutorial.gacha_inspect_battle.title"
msgstr ""

#. English: Tier 1 Machine - Draw cost: 1 token. Low-power but plentiful gachaballs.
msgid "tooltip.gacha_t1"
msgstr ""

#. English: Tier 2 Machine - Draw cost: 2 tokens. Balanced power and cost.
msgid "tooltip.gacha_t2"
msgstr ""

#. English: Tier 3 Machine - Draw cost: 3 tokens. High-power high-risk draws.
msgid "tooltip.gacha_t3"
msgstr ""

#. English: Gold - Spend at shops to buy gachaballs and reroll stock.
msgid "tooltip.gold"
msgstr ""

#. English: Tokens - Earn from flashcard minigame. Spend to draw gachaballs.
msgid "tooltip.tokens"
msgstr ""

#. English: Day - Enemies grow stronger each day. How long can you survive?
msgid "tooltip.day"
msgstr ""

#. English: Hero Health - If this reaches zero your run ends.
msgid "tooltip.hero_hp"
msgstr ""

#. English: End your management phase and start combat.
msgid "tooltip.end_turn"
msgstr ""

#. English: View defeated units and discarded items.
msgid "tooltip.discard_pile"
msgstr ""

#. English: Inspect your gachaball collection across all tiers.
msgid "tooltip.inventory"
msgstr ""

#. English: Reserve slot - Units and items here wait to be deployed or equipped.
msgid "tooltip.bench_slot"
msgstr ""

#. English: Battle slot - Units here fight in combat.
msgid "tooltip.lineup_slot"
msgstr ""

#. English: Equipped item slot - Items equipped on this unit provide bonuses.
msgid "tooltip.item_slot"
msgstr ""

#. English: Trinket - Provides passive bonuses for your entire run.
msgid "tooltip.trinket_slot"
msgstr ""

#. English: Refresh shop stock. Cost increases each reroll.
msgid "tooltip.reroll"
msgstr ""

#. English: Spend tokens from the minigame to permanently increase hero HP.
msgid "tooltip.train_hp"
msgstr ""

#. English: Spend tokens from the minigame to permanently increase hero PWR.
msgid "tooltip.train_pwr"
msgstr ""

