#. English: A survivor who learned that every kill counts. Low stats but gold flows freely.
msgid "hero.flavor"
msgstr ""

#. English: Master of temporal magic, the Timekeeper bends time itself to extend the minigame timer.
msgid "hero_timekeeper.flavor"
msgstr ""

#. English: Learn the angular Japanese syllabary used for foreign words and loanwords.
msgid "deck.katakana.desc"
msgstr ""

#. English: Master the flowing Japanese syllabary for native words and grammar.
msgid "deck.hiragana.desc"
msgstr ""

#. English: Challenge yourself with 100 essential Chinese characters used in Japanese writing.
msgid "deck.kanji_100.desc"
msgstr ""

#. English: Build your German vocabulary with 100 common and essential words.
msgid "deck.german_100.desc"
msgstr ""

#. English: Expand your Portuguese vocabulary with 100 essential everyday words.
msgid "deck.portuguese_100.desc"
msgstr ""

