#. English: Tectonic Bulwark
msgid "ability.trait_earth.name"
msgstr ""

#. English: Grants Armor and Spikes to Earth units and allies, empowering Spikes to deal bonus damage on attack.
msgid "ability.trait_earth.desc"
msgstr ""

#. English: Cleansing Tide
msgid "ability.trait_water.name"
msgstr ""

#. English: Water units heal allies ahead and cleanse negative status effects pre-combat.
msgid "ability.trait_water.desc"
msgstr ""

#. English: Restorative Spring
msgid "ability.trait_water_turn_start.name"
msgstr ""

#. English: At turn start, heals lowest HP ally and converts negative statuses into healing.
msgid "ability.trait_water_turn_start.desc"
msgstr ""

#. English: Static Tempest
msgid "ability.trait_air.name"
msgstr ""

#. English: Air units electrify targets with Static on attack, splashing charges to adjacent enemies.
msgid "ability.trait_air.desc"
msgstr ""

#. English: Bastion Guard
msgid "ability.trait_tank.name"
msgstr ""

#. English: Grants Armor pre-combat, passes armor backward on absorption, intercepts attacks, and mirrors armor as spikes.
msgid "ability.trait_tank.desc"
msgstr ""

#. English: Frontline Reinforcement
msgid "ability.trait_tank_turn_start.name"
msgstr ""

#. English: At turn start, grants 1 Armor to the frontmost Tank.
msgid "ability.trait_tank_turn_start.desc"
msgstr ""

#. English: Battle Prowess
msgid "ability.trait_fighter.name"
msgstr ""

#. English: Deals bonus damage against high-health targets, retaliates on attack damage, cleaves behind targets, and chains attacks on kill.
msgid "ability.trait_fighter.desc"
msgstr ""

#. English: Formation Blessing
msgid "ability.trait_support.name"
msgstr ""

#. English: Grants +1 HP to the ally ahead, +1 PWR to the ally behind, and +1 HP/+1 PWR to the Hero.
msgid "ability.trait_support.desc"
msgstr ""

#. English: Inspiring Presence
msgid "ability.trait_support_turn_start.name"
msgstr ""

#. English: At turn start, grants +1 HP to lowest-HP ally and +1 PWR to lowest-PWR ally per living Support.
msgid "ability.trait_support_turn_start.desc"
msgstr ""

#. English: Resource Mastery
msgid "ability.trait_specialist.name"
msgstr ""

#. English: Ensures opening tokens, discounts gacha draws, earns gold on kill, and summons a combat clone to the bench.
msgid "ability.trait_specialist.desc"
msgstr ""

#. English: Golden Ambition
msgid "ability.trait_specialist_turn_start.name"
msgstr ""

#. English: At turn start, the frontmost Specialist gains +1 PWR per 5 Gold held.
msgid "ability.trait_specialist_turn_start.desc"
msgstr ""

#. English: Nutrient Infusion
msgid "ability.trait_food.name"
msgstr ""

#. English: Heals and empowers the ally directly behind when hurt, and passes down all PWR on death.
msgid "ability.trait_food.desc"
msgstr ""

#. English: Overclocked Core
msgid "ability.trait_mecha.name"
msgstr ""

#. English: Grants Armor and Spikes, inflicts Static on attack, fires lasers on ally merges, and detonates retaliatory lasers on death.
msgid "ability.trait_mecha.desc"
msgstr ""

#. English: Primal Frenzy
msgid "ability.trait_animal.name"
msgstr ""

#. English: Grants +1 PWR to an alpha Animal pre-combat and heals Animals on every attack.
msgid "ability.trait_animal.desc"
msgstr ""

#. English: Verdant Growth
msgid "ability.trait_plant.name"
msgstr ""

#. English: Grants Spikes and HP pre-combat, and converts all incoming heals into Spikes.
msgid "ability.trait_plant.desc"
msgstr ""

#. English: Floral Rejuvenation
msgid "ability.trait_plant_turn_start.name"
msgstr ""

#. English: At turn start, heals the lowest-HP Plant, and grants +1 Spikes and +1 HP to all Plants.
msgid "ability.trait_plant_turn_start.desc"
msgstr ""

#. English: Static Discharge
msgid "ability.trait_toy.name"
msgstr ""

#. English: Inflicts Static on melee attackers, and detonates the enemy with the most Static stacks on death.
msgid "ability.trait_toy.desc"
msgstr ""

#. English: Thermal Grid
msgid "ability.trait_appliance.name"
msgstr ""

#. English: Appliance attacks inflict Static and Burn. Grants immunity and pre-combat cleanse to both, reflects incoming status effects, and converts debuffs into stats.
msgid "ability.trait_appliance.desc"
msgstr ""

#. English: Mimic Masquerade
msgid "ability.trait_costume.name"
msgstr ""

#. English: Pre-Combat: Steals beneficial status effects or base stats from mirrored enemies and enemy leaders.
msgid "ability.trait_costume.desc"
msgstr ""

